WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.380
Welcome back, champ!

2
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:16.080
Last time: fixed rules vs learning

3
00:00:16.080 --> 00:00:22.540
Chapter 3 · Where AI Hides in Daily Life

4
00:00:22.540 --> 00:00:35.970
AI is hiding everywhere. Let's go hunting!

5
00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:46.750
Meet Anaya, and Tara the voice helper

6
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:51.700
"Tara, play my favourite song!"

7
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:56.220
The song starts playing!

8
00:00:56.220 --> 00:01:07.370
How did Tara understand Anaya? Think!

9
00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:24.070
Tara guesses your words from patterns

10
00:01:24.070 --> 00:01:35.170
Not alive. Not magic. A clever guesser!

11
00:01:35.170 --> 00:01:46.880
AI helper = guesses or suggests from patterns

12
00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:59.730
Guessing or suggesting? Probably AI!

13
00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:07.430
Nani: "Find the photos of Laddoo!"

14
00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:19.380
Type "dog" → only the dog photos appear!

15
00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:26.590
Nobody named each photo. How did it know?

16
00:02:26.590 --> 00:02:41.950
AI learned what dogs look like from examples

17
00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:53.670
Bunny ears sit right on her head!

18
00:02:53.670 --> 00:03:06.930
AI finds the pattern of a face

19
00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:12.360
Anaya watches a cricket video

20
00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:20.510
"You might like…" More cricket!

21
00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:31.750
Recommendation = a suggestion from patterns

22
00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:38.990
Sunday drive with a map app

23
00:03:38.990 --> 00:03:50.210
Why is that road red on the map?

24
00:03:50.210 --> 00:04:00.880
Red = slow traffic, learned from many phones

25
00:04:00.880 --> 00:04:08.610
It suggests a faster road. That's AI!

26
00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:20.820
Kabir's toy car flashes lights and beeps

27
00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:28.680
Is the blinking toy car AI? Think!

28
00:04:28.680 --> 00:04:40.580
Not AI! Same lights every time: a fixed rule

29
00:04:40.580 --> 00:04:54.600
Shiny or noisy isn't AI. Learning is!

30
00:04:54.600 --> 00:05:09.750
Which one in the kitchen uses AI?

31
00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:20.600
The voice speaker! The rest follow fixed rules

32
00:05:20.600 --> 00:05:24.550
Your turn: practice check

33
00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:34.730
Name one AI helper and what it tries to do

34
00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:49.210
Voice helper: understands you · Map: traffic

35
00:05:49.210 --> 00:05:57.190
Voice · Photos · Videos · Maps use AI

36
00:05:57.190 --> 00:06:01.100
AI guesses or suggests from patterns

37
00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:06.190
A blinking toy is NOT AI

38
00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:10.430
Ask: does it learn from examples?

39
00:06:10.430 --> 00:06:15.780
Chapter 3 done!

40
00:06:15.780 --> 00:06:22.580
Next: Quiz · Tap Finish
